# TutorMe API Contract

Base URL: http://localhost:8080/api

## Endpoints

POST /notes
Create a lesson note.

GET /notes
Retrieve all lesson notes for the tutor dashboard.

PUT /notes/{id}/approve
Approve a lesson note.

GET /families/{familyId}/notes
Retrieve lesson notes for a specific family.

## Create Note Request

{
    "familyId": 1,
    "title": "Algebra Lesson",
    "content": "Reviewed quadratic equations."
}

## Note Response

{
    "id": 1,
    "familyId": 1,
    "title": "Algebra Lesson",
    "content": "Reviewed quadratic equations.",
    "approved": false,
    "createdAt": "2026-11-25T15:00:00Z"
}

## Integration Requirements

- All requests and responses use JSON.
- GET endpoints return arrays of lesson notes.
- POST returns the created lesson note.
- PUT returns the updated lesson note.
- New notes have approved set to false.
- Allow requests from http://localhost:5173.
- Family endpoints must only return notes belonging
  to the requested family.
- Return HTTP 404 for nonexistent note IDs.
